{
  "title": "Quenched Chewy Ukrainian Peanut Stew",
  "description": "A rich and chewy Ukrainian dish featuring peanuts, perfect for curing hangovers, made in a traditional ttukbaegi earthenware cook and served on a bamboo tray, following ayurvedic sattvic friendly principles.",
  "cuisine": "Ukrainian",
